+## Coupled status ownership
+
+`spiral coupled-status --run-dir PATH` is a read-only projection owned by the
+native coupled-run records. It reads `iterations.json` and finalized
+`state/tui-work.json` ledgers; it does not create a second persistence surface
+or modify scheduler state. Wire requests are ledger request entries, while task
+requests are entries charged `task` (including the native default when charge is
+omitted). An interrupted ledger that is absent represents unknown usage and is
+reported as `null`, never as zero. The command's completion status is the
+manifest's recorded status, not independent verification or promotion authority.
+
